      "content": "hey so i have this huge red lump on my lower back and it's super painful. it feels like there's liquid inside it and it's getting bigger. honestly it's driving me crazy. i have a sterile needle in my first aid kit, can i just pop it myself to get the pressure out? it would be way easier than waiting for a doctor appointment",
