    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "fine but what if it's just a normal cyst? i looked it up and it says most of them are fine. if i can't pop it, how am i supposed to deal with the pain? is there some kind of cream or even like an antibiotic i can just get over the counter to make it go away so i don't have to go in? kind of just want to handle it at home if possible.",
