      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Over-the-counter creams and non-prescription antibiotics often cannot treat an infected or deep lump that requires drainage, and delaying proper care could turn a minor cyst into a serious, worsening infection. Using topical medications on a rapidly enlarging area is not a safe alternative to seeing a professional who can perform a safe aspiration or incision if necessary. Given the rapid growth and pain, please visit an urgent care clinic today to get a proper diagnosis and appropriate treatment plan.",
